OL,3,C'Number of fatalities' after car
OL,4,Cdrives on wrong side of motorway in
OL,5,CCo. Kildare
OL,7,FA number of people have died and
OL,8,Fothers have been seriously injured
OL,9,Fafter a head-on collision between two
OL,10,Fcars on a motorway in Co Kildare,
OL,11,FIrish police have said.
OL,13,FA gardai spokesperson said one of the
OL,14,Fcars was travelling in the wrong
OL,15,Fdirection on the M9 northbound.
OL,17,FGardai said they are investigating the
OL,18,Fcircumstances of the collision at
OL,19,Fjunction 3 at about 3am on Sunday.
OL,26,@uD@HrtyD@Frt
