OL,3,C'Number of fatalities' after car
OL,4,Cdrives on wrong side of motorway in
OL,5,CCo. Kildare
OL,7,FEmergency services were alerted to a
OL,8,Fvehicle travelling southbound on the
OL,9,FM9 northbound carriageway.
OL,11,FThe vehicle was travelling between
OL,12,Fjunctions 3 and 4 when it collided
OL,13,Fhead-on with another car.
OL,15,FA gardai spokesperson said: "A number
OL,16,Fof fatalities have occurred and no
OL,17,Ffurther details are available at this
OL,18,Ftime."
OL,26,@wD@HrtwD@]OUzD@FO]
