PN,41203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786889892
OL,3,C'Number of fatalities' after car
OL,4,Cdrives on wrong side of motorway in
OL,5,CCo. Kildare
OL,7,FThe spokesperson said the female
OL,8,Fdriver and front-seat passenger, both
OL,9,Faged in their 30s, of the second car
OL,10,Fhave been taken to Tallaght University
OL,11,FHospital and both remain in critical
OL,12,Fcondition.
OL,14,FA female rear-seat passenger, aged in
OL,15,Fher 20s, was taken to St Luke's
OL,16,FGeneral Hospital and is in a serious
OL,17,Fcondition.
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/6
