PN,41204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786889892
OL,3,C'Number of fatalities' after car
OL,4,Cdrives on wrong side of motorway in
OL,5,CCo. Kildare
OL,7,FThe third passenger, a child, has been
OL,8,Ftaken to the Children's Health Ireland
OL,9,Fat Crumlin and is in a serious
OL,10,Fcondition.
OL,12,FThe M9 from junction 3 to junction 4
OL,13,Fnorthbound and southbound remains
OL,14,Fclosed with local diversions in place.
OL,16,FA garda forensic collision examination
OL,17,Fwill take place.
OL,19,FGardai are appealing for anyone who
OL,20,Fmay have witnessed the collision to
OL,21,Fcome forward.
