OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F412A1786889892
OL,3,C'Number of fatalities' after car
OL,4,Cdrives on wrong side of motorway in
OL,5,CCo. Kildare
OL,7,FFiosru, the Office of the Police
OL,8,FOmbudsman, has been notified.
OL,10,FA statement from Fiosru said: "The
OL,11,Freferral was made following a fatal
OL,12,Froad traffic incident on the M9.
OL,14,F"One of Fiosru's on-call team of
OL,15,Finvestigators attended the scene and
OL,16,Fits independent investigation is
OL,17,Fongoing.
