OL,3,C'Number of fatalities' after car
OL,4,Cdrives on wrong side of motorway in
OL,5,CCo. Kildare
OL,7,F"In line with its statutory remit,
OL,8,FFiosru's investigation relates to
OL,9,Fincidents involving contact with
OL,10,Fgardai where a member of the public
OL,11,Fhas died or been seriously injured."
